{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>eXoSpace\u00a0Combat\u00a0Engineer</strong> sends you on a bounty hunt through the most dangerous regions of the galaxy. Only your ship design, piloting skills, and adaptability will keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/65c7e4a604377be895bc7e4c88bf631b.avif?t=1758876806\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/92d91152ecbe6072399f99f1f675b953.poster.avif?t=1758876806\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/92d91152ecbe6072399f99f1f675b953.webm?t=1758876806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/92d91152ecbe6072399f99f1f675b953.mp4?t=1758876806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your ships</strong> by snapping modules into place and iterate quickly based on performance in combat. Create anything from a nimble fighter to a heavily armored juggernaut, balancing thrusters, armor, weapons, and energy systems.<br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/44d77c6e93e28b11d77c67e9100a47c9.avif?t=1758876806\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/4980ed4642e5cedd331d04dc4047b2a8.poster.avif?t=1758876806\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/4980ed4642e5cedd331d04dc4047b2a8.webm?t=1758876806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/4980ed4642e5cedd331d04dc4047b2a8.mp4?t=1758876806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot in explosive, physics-driven battles.</strong> As an eXoSpace Combat Engineer, every mission begins with a fresh ship and a set of blueprints. Modules you unlock will challenge you to adapt on each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the unknown.</strong> Make your way to your target deep within eXoSpace, where each hyperjump brings unpredictable encounters\u2014sometimes friendly, often dangerous. Each hunt ends with a <strong>boss fight</strong> against your target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b8ac12dbdcf6dfcaad94f988d03a5a47.avif?t=1758876806\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two missions are the same</strong>: randomized maps, enemies, events, and outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock perks and new ships</strong> using the bounties you collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox mode</strong> lets you freely build ships and command massive space battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of modules</strong> to discover, including pistons, rotators, and powerful unique parts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive modding support</strong> for ship modules, AI scripts, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Steam Workshop integration</strong> for sharing and downloading designs and mods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional <strong>Hardcore Mode</strong> for those who want the ultimate challenge where death is permanent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXoSpace is a passion project by Fantastimaker, an independent game studio consisting of just Bas, its developer, marketeer and designer.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2876200?t=1758876806","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/6b852a33270fecc97c030861ae6899337f8900fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758876806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/0c6cb0eb4c88ca735407ea4aee052f591ef724c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758876806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/0c6cb0eb4c88ca735407ea4aee052f591ef724c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758876806","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3756720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>eXoSpace\u00a0Combat\u00a0Engineer</strong> sends you on a bounty hunt through the most dangerous regions of the galaxy. Only your ship design, piloting skills, and adaptability will keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/65c7e4a604377be895bc7e4c88bf631b.avif?t=1758876806\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/92d91152ecbe6072399f99f1f675b953.poster.avif?t=1758876806\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/92d91152ecbe6072399f99f1f675b953.webm?t=1758876806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/92d91152ecbe6072399f99f1f675b953.mp4?t=1758876806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your ships</strong> by snapping modules into place and iterate quickly based on performance in combat. Create anything from a nimble fighter to a heavily armored juggernaut, balancing thrusters, armor, weapons, and energy systems.<br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/44d77c6e93e28b11d77c67e9100a47c9.avif?t=1758876806\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/4980ed4642e5cedd331d04dc4047b2a8.poster.avif?t=1758876806\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/4980ed4642e5cedd331d04dc4047b2a8.webm?t=1758876806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/4980ed4642e5cedd331d04dc4047b2a8.mp4?t=1758876806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot in explosive, physics-driven battles.</strong> As an eXoSpace Combat Engineer, every mission begins with a fresh ship and a set of blueprints. Modules you unlock will challenge you to adapt on each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the unknown.</strong> Make your way to your target deep within eXoSpace, where each hyperjump brings unpredictable encounters\u2014sometimes friendly, often dangerous. Each hunt ends with a <strong>boss fight</strong> against your target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b8ac12dbdcf6dfcaad94f988d03a5a47.avif?t=1758876806\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two missions are the same</strong>: randomized maps, enemies, events, and outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock perks and new ships</strong> using the bounties you collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox mode</strong> lets you freely build ships and command massive space battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of modules</strong> to discover, including pistons, rotators, and powerful unique parts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive modding support</strong> for ship modules, AI scripts, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Steam Workshop integration</strong> for sharing and downloading designs and mods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional <strong>Hardcore Mode</strong> for those who want the ultimate challenge where death is permanent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXoSpace is a passion project by Fantastimaker, an independent game studio consisting of just Bas, its developer, marketeer and designer.</p>","developers":["Fantastimaker"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/8a8f9a6293c9d25b0929a9a4a1df6d7ca8af7d6c/header.jpg?t=1758876806","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025 Bas @ Fantastimaker","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Min